{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3ff8f3ee6b124afef735271e973c39de2525d447adcaad2435ae3167b19c3bfc","ja":"突然の謝罪","zh":"突然的道歉","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c66d795cb4e86252ade5ce3899c50678d1f1abb46fe2ea9b474d3bfbd8477c61","ja":"次はこちらで撮影するのね。\nわあ……とってもきれいなお庭ね。","zh":"接下来要在这里拍摄呢。\n哇……好漂亮的庭院啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e87224d58631eedaaa688f0b3339ee86b101c6d291d91996b96f91b25605f8d4","ja":"はい、趣きのある美しい庭園ですね。\n隅々まで手入れが行き届いていて。","zh":"是的，真是一座雅致优美的庭园呢。\n各处都被打理得井井有条。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3cbc8fd5cb9b75407a80dad82d51cb31f02cbc8d76a22ca12681fbd58c8b7ed0","ja":"あっ、あちらには藤が咲いていますよ。\n少し遅い時期ですけど、まだ綺麗ですね……ふふ。","zh":"啊，那边开着紫藤花呢。\n虽然花期有点晚了，不过依然很美呢……呵呵。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3e67a1ae339746c70adf371134618a0deb5a847d1a941fecbdd1bf54ee2a86e1","ja":"へえ、そうなんだ。\n紬ちゃんって、こういう場所が本当に好きなのね。","zh":"哎，是这样啊。\n紬真的很喜欢这种地方呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e64c8852013ef75f3055ae9a93900d210e8b57b758e711c51eac0d37233e72c7","ja":"はい。こちらにも、\nいつかお伺いしたいと思っていました。","zh":"好的。我也一直想着\n什么时候能来拜访这里呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a871d53043bc8bd816545a08d0a93a3eabc735b0bd247bc59742eac1851f9526","ja":"じゃあせっかくだし、藤と一緒の写真も\n撮ってもらいましょうか。","zh":"那就难得来一趟，顺便也让人\n帮我们和紫藤拍张合照吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"92a91baaea777fe2e48926d9b6e2578813fd076db5d39a1d32e2e52899087a15","ja":"（次こそはエレガントにしなきゃ！\n紬ちゃんをお手本にして……）","zh":"（下次一定要举止优雅！\n拿小紬当榜样……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"18cc68976d3161d4cf7070f5f23ac2015fc78bdadef06532d607fab2c7600351","ja":"そして数時間後。撮影が終わって……","zh":"数小时后。拍摄结束了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"08f2670b46c6bd208ef6303e66a8db285d62d44432ff033a82dc78b566ca92d0","ja":"（ふう……結局、今日はパッとしないまま\n終わってしまったわね……）","zh":"（呼……结果今天也是平淡无奇地\n结束了呢……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a9201ef1be78d97e9133f48048cf4153c8fbf00a2fcaf51886bce4400ea47ab7","ja":"（紬ちゃんにも迷惑をかけてしまったし、\nせめて一言、謝っておかないと……）","zh":"（给小紬也添了麻烦，\n至少得去道个歉才行……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"783f758d1279c5b83ecb432b40c9fdca5ba2e248e0740e6924f480322935ff1e","ja":"あの、紬ちゃん。\n今日は……。","zh":"那个，小紬。\n今天……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"56f348826c36f77402cfdab01de1dc613a2c9c52d359b08420702b3401b5067b","ja":"桜守さん……今日は足を引っ張ってしまって、\n申し訳ありませんでした！","zh":"桜守小姐……今天拖了您的后腿，\n真的很对不起！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1249.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"d72ac0fab8785b735c546b423b13146e13d37e84e6b539bda23f1ddcaffb95df","ja":"…………ええっ！？","zh":"…………诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
